_Thumbnail_0.jpg","imagePanorama":"","trailer":"","videoUrl":"","price":310,"usdPrice":3.6,"isFree":false,"rating":4.5,"ratingCount":25,"avgStars":4.5,"totalStars":25,"packType":"SkinPack","isVibrant":false,"version":"1.0.1","creationDate":"2021-08-09T10:35:30.244Z","lastModifiedDate":"2026-06-10T22:06:25.256Z","contentSize":null,"contentPieces":1,"downloadable":true,"screenshotCount":0},{"id":"fea3f10b-1889-4613-9dda-ebcd51143975","uuid":"fea3f10b-1889-4613-9dda-ebcd51143975","type":"skinpack","title":"Popular Camo","creator":"The Craft Stars","creatorId":null,"description":"What a way to hide! It’s hard to see you when you look like the most popular blocks. Choose from 12 different skins that are the perfect disguise. Role-play in cool camouflage with only eyes and a mouth to give you away. Will anyone recognize you?\r\n\r\n1 free skin included!","image":"https://xforgeassets001.xboxlive.com/pf-title-b63a0803d3653643-20ca2/5d27dc32-0bdf-4e56-89d4-59bcb09b47ae/PopularCamo_Thumbnail_0.jpg","packIconUrl":"","thumbnailUrl":"https://xforgeassets001.xboxlive.com/pf-title-b63a0803d3653643-20ca2/5d27dc32-0bdf-4e56-89d4-59bcb09b47ae/PopularCamo_Thumbnail_0.jpg","imagePanorama":"","trailer":"","videoUrl":"","price":310,"usdPrice":3.6,"isFree":false,"rating":4.7,"ratingCount":176,"avgStars":4.7,"totalStars":176,"packType":"SkinPack","isVibrant":false,"version":"1.0.1","creationDate":"2021-08-09T10:32:48.811Z","lastModifiedDate":"2026-06-10T22:10:49.304Z","contentSize":null,"contentPieces":1,"downloadable":true,"screenshotCount":0},{"id":"f8c721d8-6463-4b6e-ae63-962353b7d324","uuid":"f8c721d8-6463-4b6e-ae63-962353b7d324","type":"skinpack","title":"Toy Warden","creator":"The Craft Stars","creatorId":null,"description":"Become a big, bad, cheerful mob from the deep dark biome. Enjoy role-playing as a not so scary warden, with a toy-like look. Choose from 12 different strong boss skins, full of joy and cheer. It will be hard to frighten anyone because you just look too colorful,